    ["<Assistant_Title1>【四方联赛】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>四方联赛</>是俱乐部之间的大型战场玩法。每场由<Assistant_Red>4家俱乐部</>同场竞技，每家俱乐部最多出战<Assistant_Red>60名正式成员</>，单局共<Assistant_Red>240名玩家</>参战；同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Assistant_Red>16人</>。每场比赛持续<Assistant_Red>23分钟</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>赛制规则：</>每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下随机分配。第一场各组前2名进入胜者组，后2名进入败者组；第二场分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，确定本轮第1至第8名。\n<Assistant_Title2>胜负规则：</>率先获得<Assistant_Red>3000积分</>的俱乐部立即锁定胜局；若对局结束时无人达到3000分，则按当前积分排名。积分相同时，依次比较<Assistant_Property1>总击杀数</>、<Assistant_Property1>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>局内积分：</>局内积分唯一来源为守卫归属结算。首次占领守卫获得<Assistant_Red>50积分</>；每<Assistant_Red>5秒</>小结算时，每个已占领守卫提供<Assistant_Red>1积分</>；每<Assistant_Red>30秒</>大结算时，每个已占领守卫提供<Assistant_Red>18积分</>。对局第<Assistant_Red>4、8、12、16、20分钟</>会随机刷新守卫归属高倍积分结算，高倍结算时每个已占领守卫提供<Assistant_Red>72或108积分</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>战略服筛选积分：</>在<Assistant_Property1>战略服筛选阶段</>的联赛前两轮，将启用战略服筛选积分规则。只有<Assistant_Property1>神话组</>的俱乐部可获得战略服筛选积分。单场第1至第4名依次获得<Assistant_Red>30、15、10、5分</>；第一轮最终第1至第4名依次获得<Assistant_Red>60、50、45、40分</>，第5至第8名各获得<Assistant_Red>10分</>；第二轮最终第1至第4名依次获得<Assistant_Red>200、100、70、50分</>，第5至第8名各获得<Assistant_Red>15分</>。战略服筛选阶段的联赛前两轮结束后，本赛区战略服筛选总积分前4名的俱乐部将晋级<Assistant_Property1>四方联赛天启组</>，并获得<Assistant_Property1>参与战略服</>的资格。\n<Assistant_Title2>同分排序：</>战略服筛选排名优先按<Assistant_Property1>战略服筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Assistant_Property1>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n<Assistant_Title2>守卫争夺：</>战场中共有<Assistant_Red>5位守卫</>。完成对守卫最后一击的俱乐部会获得该守卫的控制权；守卫归属后会立即重生并归属本方。守卫无法被治疗，但周围没有敌人时会缓慢自动回血。\n<Assistant_Title2>资源与指挥：</>击败敌方玩家或占领守卫可获得资源点，并自动积累士气等级。会长、外交官、理事可消耗资源点释放指挥技能。\n<Assistant_Title2>指挥技能：</><Assistant_Property1>克敌宣言</>消耗1000资源点，使全体成员全途径压制提高15%，持续20秒，冷却180秒；<Assistant_Property1>急行进军</>消耗600资源点，使全体成员移动速度提高60%，持续10秒，冷却120秒；<Assistant_Property1>归零敕令</>消耗1500资源点，清除全体成员当前复活等待并覆盖随后5秒内阵亡成员，冷却240秒；<Assistant_Property1>召集传送</>消耗2400资源点，将全体成员召集至指定集结点，冷却240秒；<Assistant_Property1>圣域庇佑</>消耗1000资源点，使本方全部守卫恢复50%最大生命值，冷却180秒。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往四方联赛]|1250063}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Four-Way League】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Four-Way League</> is a large-scale battlefield mode between Clubs. Each match features <Assistant_Red>4 Clubs</> competing on the same field, with each Club fielding up to <Assistant_Red>60 official members</>, for a total of <Assistant_Red>240 players</> per match. A single Club can have a maximum of <Assistant_Red>16 players</> of the same Pathway on the field. Each match lasts <Assistant_Red>23 minutes</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tournament Rules:</> Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams from the current group are assigned to different match groups, with random distribution applied while satisfying this rule. The top 2 teams from each group in the first match enter the Winners' Bracket, while the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match features separate duels for the Winners' and Losers' Brackets to determine the 1st through 8th place rankings for the round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Win/Loss Rules:</> The first Club to reach <Assistant_Red>3000 points</> immediately secures victory. If no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, rankings are determined by current points. In the event of a tie, <Assistant_Property1>Total Kills</> and <Assistant_Property1>Total Club Beyonder Rating</> are compared in order.\n<Assistant_Title2>In-Match Points:</> The only source of in-match points is the settlement of Guardian ownership. The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Assistant_Red>50 points</>. During small settlements every <Assistant_Red>5 seconds</>, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>1 point</>. During large settlements every <Assistant_Red>30 seconds</>, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>18 points</>. At the <Assistant_Red>4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes</> of the match, high-multiplier point settlements for Guardian ownership will refresh randomly; during these high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian provides <Assistant_Red>72 or 108 points</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategic Server Screening Points:</> During the first two rounds of the league in the <Assistant_Property1>Strategic Server Screening Phase</>, the Strategic Server Screening point rules will be enabled. Only Clubs in the <Assistant_Property1>God Group</> can earn Strategic Server Screening points. In a single match, 1st to 4th place receive <Assistant_Red>30, 15, 10, and 5 points</> respectively. In the first round, the final 1st to 4th place receive <Assistant_Red>60, 50, 45, and 40 points</> respectively, and 5th to 8th place each receive <Assistant_Red>10 points</>. In the second round, the final 1st to 4th place receive <Assistant_Red>200, 100, 70, and 50 points</> respectively, and 5th to 8th place each receive <Assistant_Red>15 points</>. After the first two rounds of the league in the Strategic Server Screening phase are completed, the 4 Clubs with the highest total Strategic Server Screening points in this region will advance to the <Assistant_Property1>Four-Way League Apocalypse Group</> and gain the qualification to <Assistant_Property1>Participate in the Strategic Server</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tie-Breaking:</> Strategic Server Screening rankings are primarily ordered by <Assistant_Property1>Total Strategic Server Screening Points</> from highest to lowest. If the total points are tied: after the first or second round of the league, rankings are determined by the Club's <Assistant_Property1>Final Ranking</> in that round, with the higher rank taking precedence. After the first match of each round of the Four-Way League, since the final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, tied Clubs are not distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round.\n<Assistant_Title2>Guardian Contention:</> There are <Assistant_Red>5 Guardians</> on the battlefield. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian gains control of it. Once ownership is established, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to that side. Guardians cannot be healed, but they will slowly and automatically Heal when there are no enemies nearby.\n<Assistant_Title2>Resources and Command:</> Defeating enemy players or occupying Guardians grants Resource Points and automatically accumulates Morale Level. The Club Leader, Diplomats, and Councilors can consume Resource Points to unleash Command Skills.\n<Assistant_Title2>Command Skills:</><Assistant_Property1>Declaration of Defeating the Enemy</> consumes 1000 Resource Points, increasing all members' Pathway Suppression by 15% for 20 seconds, with a 180-second Cooldown; <Assistant_Property1>Forced March</> consumes 600 Resource Points, increasing all members' movement speed by 60% for 10 seconds, with a 120-second Cooldown; <Assistant_Property1>Zeroing Edict</> consumes 1500 Resource Points, clearing the current Resurrection wait time for all members and covering members who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds, with a 240-second Cooldown; <Assistant_Property1>Summon Teleport</> consumes 2400 Resource Points, summoning all members to the designated rally point, with a 240-second Cooldown; <Assistant_Property1>Sanctuary Protection</> consumes 1000 Resource Points, restoring 50% of the maximum Health of all friendly Guardians, with a 180-second Cooldown.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Four-Way League]|1250063}",
    ["<Highlight>负面效果</>：佩戴它的时候情绪会被放大，必须懂得控制自己，否则很容易出问题。"] = "<Highlight>Negative Effects</>: When wearing it, emotions will be amplified. One must know how to control oneself, otherwise, it is very easy for problems to arise.",
