    ["向亚多尼斯解释"] = "Explain to Adonis",
    ["封印物能力生效的十分钟内，被窃取者会直接失去对应的能力，佩戴者则可以熟练地使用，十分钟后该项能力消失，被窃取者要等到第二天才能恢复。\n<Highlight>负面效果</>：凡是触碰到它的人，不管有没有保护，都会被偷走生命。最开始并不明显，但如果一直不脱离接触，那半个小时之后，就会有对应的外在表现了。一位序列5的邪教徒支撑了两个小时，从三十多岁的壮汉变成了身体佝偻，皮肤松皱，头发白而稀疏，牙齿全部掉光的衰老之人。"] = "Within ten minutes of the Sealed Artifact's ability taking effect, the victim will directly lose the corresponding ability, while the wearer can use it proficiently. After ten minutes, the ability will Disappear, and the victim must wait until the next day to recover.\n<Highlight>Negative Effect</>: Anyone who touches it, regardless of whether they have protection, will have their Health stolen. It is not obvious at first, but if contact is maintained, after half an hour, there will be corresponding external manifestations. A Sequence 5 cultist lasted for two hours, transforming from a robust man in his thirties into an aged person with a hunched back, loose and wrinkled skin, white and sparse hair, and all teeth fallen out.",
    ["我会试着找找他们，“四个愚蠢的亡灵”……呵，至少不会太孤单。"] = "I'll try to find them, the 'four foolish undead'... Heh, at least they won't be too lonely.",
    ["我听到声音，以为是闹鬼了，根本不敢靠近……"] = "I heard a sound and thought it was a haunting, so I didn't dare to get close at all...",
    ["我说我成年了，怎么？我很显小？"] = "I said I'm an adult, so what? Do I look that young?",
    ["看我露一手！"] = "Watch me show you how it's done!",
    ["累充"] = "Cumulative Top-up",
